    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LITTLE KYA: TAKE THAT, SPANIARDS!\nKYA: Everybody else was quick to get out, same way.",
      "MABEL: You helping out your Pa while your Ma's gone?\nKYA: Yes ma'am. Keeping the house clean for her and everything.",
      "LITTLE KYA: I hear tell y'all buy mussels? I got some here. And some scuppernong jam.\nMABEL: Yesiree, we sure do. They fresh?\nLITTLE KYA: I dug 'em before dawn. Just now.",
      "KYA: Hey, I need help. Somebody's been taking pictures of my house.\nMABEL: They've been all over. Developers. Want to drain the \"murky swamp\" and build hotels.",
      "KYA: What?\nMABEL: Oh, you didn't? Heart attack."
    ]
